WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.000
[Music]

2
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.000
Yes, indeed. The Darksign brands the Undead.

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
And in this land, the Undead are corralled and led to the north,

4
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
where they are locked away, to await the end of the world.

5
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:48.000
This is your fate.

6
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Well, what do we have here?

7
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
You must be a new arrival.

8
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.800
Sen's Fortress, an old proving ground built by the ancient gods.

9
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:17.800
Very well. Now thou art a Blade of the Darkmoon.

10
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.800
Don't even consider visiting Anor Londo. Not in your state.

11
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Like a moth flittering towards a flame.

12
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.000
May the flames guide thee.
